Upstream-Name: motanka-stack
Upstream-Contact: Ruslan Babych <1285978+digitwolf@users.noreply.github.com>
Source: https://github.com/digitwolf/motanka
Comment: The source package bundles the upstream components listed in
 stack/components.tsv, one dpkg-source component per folder. The licence of
 each component below is a summary; the authoritative text is the LICENSE or
 COPYING file in the component's folder. On Ubuntu 24.04 the binary package
 motanka-stack-libs also ships a copy of GCC 16's libstdc++ and libgcc_s
 from the Ubuntu toolchain PPA (GPL-3+ with the GCC Runtime Library
 Exception 3.1).

